{"code":"he-IL","name":"Hebrew","native":"עברית","badge":"עב","tts":"he-IL","rtl":true,"about":"Lines use the masculine form. Women say מבינה (mevina), יודעת (yoda’at), צריכה (tsricha), חושבת (choshevet), מרגישה (margisha).","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"אני לא מבין.","say":"a-NEE lo me-VEEN","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"אני לא יודע.","say":"a-NEE lo yo-DE-a","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"רגע, בבקשה.","say":"RE-ga, be-va-ka-SHA","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"אפשר לחזור על זה?","say":"ef-SHAR lach-ZOR al ze","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"לאט יותר, בבקשה.","say":"le-AT yo-TER, be-va-ka-SHA","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"איך אומרים «…» בעברית?","say":"eych om-REEM … be-iv-REET","en":"How do you say “…” in Hebrew?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"בטח.","say":"BE-tach","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"בדיוק.","say":"be-DI-yuk","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"אני חושב שכן.","say":"a-NEE cho-SHEV she-KEN","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"באמת?","say":"be-e-MET","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"אין בעיה.","say":"eyn be-a-YA","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"יופי!","say":"YO-fee","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"איפה {x}?","say":"EY-fo {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"אני רוצה {x}.","say":"a-NEE ro-TSE {x}","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"יש לכם {x}?","say":"yesh la-CHEM {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, בבקשה.","say":"{x}, be-va-ka-SHA","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"אני צריך {x}.","say":"a-NEE tsa-RICH {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"אפשר {x}?","say":"ef-SHAR {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"אני אבדוק.","say":"a-NEE ev-DOK","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"יש לי פגישה.","say":"yesh lee pgee-SHA","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"זה חריף?","say":"ze cha-REEF","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"בלי בצל, בבקשה.","say":"bli ba-TSAL, be-va-ka-SHA","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"מה אתה ממליץ?","say":"ma a-TA mam-LEETS","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"אני לא אוכל בשר.","say":"a-NEE lo o-CHEL ba-SAR","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"כמה זה עולה?","say":"KA-ma ze o-LE","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"אני רק מסתכל.","say":"a-NEE rak mis-ta-KEL","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"אני אקח את זה.","say":"a-NEE e-KACH et ze","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"אפשר לשלם בכרטיס?","say":"ef-SHAR le-sha-LEM be-kar-TEES","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"זה רחוק?","say":"ze ra-CHOK","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"לשדה התעופה, בבקשה.","say":"li-SDE ha-te-u-FA, be-va-ka-SHA","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"שמאלה · ימינה · ישר","say":"SMO-la · ya-MEE-na · ya-SHAR","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"הצילו!","say":"ha-TSEE-lu","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"אין נייר טואלט.","say":"eyn ne-YAR to-a-LET","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"אני לא מרגיש טוב.","say":"a-NEE lo mar-GEESH tov","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"תזמינו אמבולנס, בבקשה.","say":"taz-MEE-nu AM-bu-lans, be-va-ka-SHA","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"נעים מאוד.","say":"na-EEM me-OD","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"מאיפה אתה?","say":"me-EY-fo a-TA","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"מה אתה עושה?","say":"ma a-TA o-SE","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"טעים מאוד!","say":"ta-EEM me-OD","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"שלום.","say":"sha-LOM","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"בוקר טוב.","say":"BO-ker tov","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"מה שלומך?","say":"ma shlom-CHA","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"כן. · לא.","say":"ken · lo","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"בבקשה.","say":"be-va-ka-SHA","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"תודה.","say":"to-DA","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"סליחה.","say":"sli-CHA","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"להתראות.","say":"le-hit-ra-OT","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"אחת · שתיים · שלוש","say":"a-CHAT · SHTA-yim · sha-LOSH","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"ארבע · חמש · שש","say":"AR-ba · cha-MESH · shesh","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"שבע · שמונה · תשע","say":"SHE-va · shmo-NE · TE-sha","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"עשר · עשרים · מאה","say":"E-ser · es-REEM · me-A","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"התפוח אדום.","say":"ha-ta-PU-ach a-DOM","en":"The apple is red.","note":"ה- (ha-) = the · no “is” · read right to left"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"אני אוכל את התפוח.","say":"a-NEE o-CHEL et ha-ta-PU-ach","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"את (et) marks a definite object"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"אכלתי את התפוח.","say":"a-CHAL-tee et ha-ta-PU-ach","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: the ending -תי (-ti) means I"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"אני רוצה לאכול את התפוח.","say":"a-NEE ro-TSE le-e-CHOL et ha-ta-PU-ach","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"want + ל- (le-) infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"אתה אוכל תפוחים?","say":"a-TA o-CHEL ta-pu-CHEEM","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"השירותים","say":"ha-sheyru-TEEM","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"בית המרקחת","say":"beyt ha-mir-KA-chat","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"בית החולים","say":"beyt ha-cho-LEEM","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"התחנה","say":"ha-ta-cha-NA","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"שדה התעופה","say":"sde ha-te-u-FA","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"המלון","say":"ha-ma-LON","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"מים","say":"MA-yim","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"קפה","say":"ka-FE","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"החשבון","say":"ha-chesh-BON","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"התפריט","say":"ha-taf-REET","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"בירה","say":"BEE-ra","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"זה","say":"ze","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"שקית","say":"sa-KEET","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"הפגישה","say":"ha-pgee-SHA","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"הקובץ","say":"ha-KO-vets","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"המסך","say":"ha-ma-SACH","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"ההודעה","say":"ha-ho-da-A","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"מחר","say":"ma-CHAR","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"ללכת","say":"la-LE-chet","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"להיכנס","say":"le-hee-ka-NES","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"לשלם","say":"le-sha-LEM","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"אלרגיה · נא לקרוא","ask":"האם יש במנה הזאת אחד מהמרכיבים האלה?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"תודה רבה!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"יש לי אלרגיה חמורה לבוטנים. אסור לי לאכול בוטנים או שמן בוטנים.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"יש לי אלרגיה חמורה לפירות ים (שרימפס, סרטנים, צדפות).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"אסור לי לאכול גלוטן (חיטה, שעורה, שיפון).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"אני לא אוכל בשר, עוף או דגים.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"אני לא אוכל חזיר.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"שירותים","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"גברים · נשים","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"יציאה · כניסה","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"דחוף · משוך","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"יציאת חירום","en":"Emergency exit"}]}